Comment: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:19.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,550)\blur1\c&HD081FF&}大好き
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------EDCN-------------------
Comment: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:53.95,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}能從你呼吸的律動感覺得到哦
Comment: 0,0:21:53.95,0:21:56.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}真是溫暖啊
Comment: 0,0:21:56.63,0:22:06.55,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}珍惜的日常生活就在這裡
Comment: 0,0:22:13.61,0:22:20.76,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}你知道嗎  你試圖藉由依偎傳達心意
Comment: 0,0:22:20.76,0:22:26.47,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}你笨拙的那點  我很喜歡哦
Comment: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:33.43,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}我現在一定很幸福
Comment: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:40.96,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}在誰也無法知曉的命運牢籠中
Comment: 0,0:22:40.96,0:22:43.65,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:48.05,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}笑著並稍微落淚
Comment: 0,0:22:48.05,0:22:51.79,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}我的存在意義
Comment: 0,0:22:51.79,0:22:58.58,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}將由你的雙手重新塑造
Comment: 0,0:23:00.47,0:23:04.21,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}你看  你看  對吧？
Comment: 0,0:23:08.52,0:23:12.07,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:23:12.07,0:23:15.60,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&H5AB5F4&}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:19.81,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,550)\blur1\c&HD081FF&}最喜歡你了
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------SCREEN-------------------
